					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Noting that the image appears to be from website TheWildUnknown.com, as stated by <a href="http://heartymagazine.com/news/the-wild-unknown-prisms">a</a> <a href="http://frommoontomoon.blogspot.com/2012/07/prism-love-wild-unknown.html">few</a> <a href="https://taminoa.wordpress.com/2010/05/10/the-wild-unknown/">blogs.</a> However, the <a href="https://www.thewildunknown.com/hanging_prism.html">link</a> where they were displayed appears to be broken. As the licensing of the image cannot be determined, it is assumed to be noncompliant and as such, has been removed.</p> 
				 	]]>
