					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-322412#post-1039979</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-322412/scp-132#post-1039979</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 10 Mar 2011 00:21:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Adam Smascher</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>587467</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><strong>Incident Log 132-01:</strong> Dr. R███████, currently stationed at Area ██, reports knocking SCP-132-71 off her desk. Upon impact with the ground, SCP-132-71 shattered and the office of Dr. R███████ was buffeted by extreme winds. Other owners of instances of SCP-132 confirm that the area shown by SCP-132 was experiencing a sandstorm.</p> </blockquote> <p>If SCP-132 is the collective and individual instances don't show the same exact area, then I think the final SCP-132 in this quoted section should be SCP-132-71.</p> <p>Other than that, I quite like this.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
