					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I will note that the air was calm for the blowtorch test and stormy in Incident 132-01. There may be a limited time that the effect can manifest or it could be that it didn't happen because SCP-132-01 was still mostly intact rather than shattered or three other things I can't think of off my head. It <em>was</em> intentional, though.</p> 
				 	]]>
